        "claim": "Broad sweep of 22 further (b,d) pairs straddling 0.33 all matched the rule, in both orders: 17/50=0.34 P, 17/52=0.3269 C, 23/69=1/3 P, 23/70=0.3286 C, 7/21 P, 7/22=0.3182 C, 11/33 P, 11/34=0.3235 C, 50/17 P, 52/17 C, 6/18 P, 6/19=0.3158 C, 9/27 P, 9/28=0.3214 C, 25/75 P, 25/76=0.3289 C, 26/78 P, 26/79=0.3291 C, 1/5 C, 5/1 C, 2/4=0.5 P, 4/2 P.",
